            "q": "The author is surprised that this is discussed so little.",
            "options": [
              "*True",
              "False"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "According to the text, a protocol can replace sensitivity.",
            "options": [
              "True",
              "*False"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "The author thinks technology cannot solve this issue.",
            "options": [
              "*True",
              "False"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
